{"ID":"20240513083224-i3fy4j9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083224-i3fy4j9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083224-i3fy4j9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134828-oj6c5k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134828-oj6c5k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134828-oj6c5k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:532,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:551\u0026#125;","title":"150","type":"doc","updated":"20240514130112"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513134828-oj6c5k1","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1052px;","id":"20240513134828-oj6c5k1","updated":"20240514130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117-13 S, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58歲,胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080516"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺積水,雙足水腫"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後,病人好轉；大汗出且睡好。腿腫漸消。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"量中等"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好轉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍未開 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ “午時”開心臟。 病人現已能睡，待午時胃口開，病就完全好了。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呼吸好轉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈稍數，但洪且穩定"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白濕厚，淡紅色現"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 效不更方"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5/13方加  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢 丹皮三錢 枳實三錢 桂枝四錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"參付   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 處方中讓病人流汗的是“桂枝”；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黃要加桂枝，方可宣瀉走表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。 麻黃無桂枝的時候，是作用在肺上面，有了桂枝方可走表，將皮膚打開。 桂枝如馬，麻黃騎在桂枝上，方可至表而達到大汗出的目的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 經方劑量是麻黃大於桂枝，但老師用藥習慣為"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝大於麻黃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。 原因是現今麻黃炮製過程我們並不清楚，有時較生有時較熟（麻黃若先炮過，  效力較低）。原方煮法為麻黃先煮，去上沫再納諸藥。但怕麻黃較熟，依古法   煮則沒有藥力；又恐麻黃較生，直接與諸藥一起煮會發汗太過，折衷結果為 → 桂枝量大於麻黃，與諸藥同煮以取得較好的藥效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"叮囑病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 遠離動物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 不要吹冷氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}